    Tron Showcase: public single-page editorial view.

    Mounted at /tron by controllers/main.py (TronShowcaseController).
    The client-side JS fetches /tron/api/instances to render the dataset
    viewer table. Content is stubbed with TODO markers pending final copy.

    Layout: standalone HTML (no portal.portal_layout). Dark editorial
    section-numbered design cloned verbatim from Kaiju Dashboard;
